":"quartic.lemma-2","kind":"claim","label":"Lemma 2","locator":"Lemma 2, Section 2","source_id":"paper","statement":"**Lemma 2** (OpenAI ([OpenAI 2026](#cite-OpenAI2026), Lemma 2.1)). *Fix $k\\ge2$. For all sufficiently large powers of four $m$,*\n$$\n L:=\\left\\lfloor m^{1-1/k}/\\ell^2\\right\\rfloor < R(P).\n\\tag{3}\n$$\n*For every $0<\\eta<1/2$ a reversible quantum algorithm with $O_k(1+\\log(1/\\eta))$ queries on every input computes $P$ with error at most $\\eta$ on its domain. There is an exact fan-in-two circuit with $S=O_k(m\\ell^2)$ gates whose two outputs are the domain bit of $P$ and, on the domain, its value.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:b01fb7dc64f90c9c1f9fb29554b974330c989197a18a158ed14e47c792db1a40/nodes/quartic.lemma-2","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:b01fb7dc64f90c9c1f9fb29554b974330c989197a18a158ed14e47c792db1a40/nodes/quartic.lemma-2","id":"sha256:b01fb7dc64f90c9c1f9fb29554b974330c989197a18a158ed14e47c792db1a40/edges/%5B%22quartic.lemma-2%22%2C%22lean.QuarticQuery.Paper.construction_lemma_2_1_complete%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:b01fb7dc64f90c9c1f9fb29554b974330c989197a18a158ed14e47c792db1a40/edges/%5B%22quartic.lemma-2%22%2C%22lean.QuarticQuery.Paper.construction_lemma_2_1_complete%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:b01fb7dc64f90c9c1f9fb29554b974330c989197a18a158ed14e47c792db1a40/nodes/lean.QuarticQuery.Paper.construction_lemma_2_1_complete"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:b01fb7dc64f90c9c1f9fb29554b974330c989197a18a158ed14e47c792db1a40/nodes/quartic.lemma-2","id":"field:045e9bb5bf32a3aa5e8645c73825cdc66f3f9410e57d54ba00fb23445e819eee","kind":"citation_ids","owner_ref":"sha256:b01fb7dc64f90c9c1f9fb29554b974330c989197a18a158ed14e47c792db1a40/nodes/quartic.lemma-2","semantic_class":"provenance_field_reference","source_field":"citation_ids","to":"sha256:b01fb7dc64f90c9c1f9fb29554b974330c989197